{"id":44057,"date":"2025-07-04T12:18:49","date_gmt":"2025-07-04T12:18:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/?post_type=faq&#038;p=44057"},"modified":"2025-07-04T12:18:49","modified_gmt":"2025-07-04T12:18:49","slug":"how-can-i-generate-a-license-for-my-offline-system","status":"publish","type":"faq","link":"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/faq\/how-can-i-generate-a-license-for-my-offline-system\/","title":{"rendered":"How can I generate a license for my (offline) system?"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Generating licenses for ntop products requires you to connect to the licensing URL you received during product purchase. You can do this from the system for which you are generating the license, or for another system that has no Internet access at all.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All you need to do is to connect to the system that you want to license and collect the required information. For instance suppose that you want to license ntopng do:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>SSH-connect to the remote system<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Type \u201cntop \u2013version\u201d<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Take note of the information reported on the screen.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>From the same system you want to license, or (if such system has no Internet access) from another system that has Internet access, do connect to the licensing URL you have received during purchase.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Enter the requested licensing information and make sure you have selected the correct product you want to generate the license for (see the dropdown menu in the license page).<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Copy the generated license and create it (using the command reported on the screen) on the remote system that you want to license.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For instance suppose you want to create the enterprise license for<\/p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>$ ntopng --version\nv.3.9.191021    &#91;Enterprise\/Professional build]\nGIT rev:    dev:d835425b89a622b9c6b96feaac05fec554a9e150:20191021\nPro rev:    r2492\nBuilt on:    Debian GNU\/Linux 8.11 (jessie)\nSystem Id:    12F54F8A00000789\nPlatform:    x86_64\nEdition:    Enterprise\nLicense Type:    Time-Limited &#91;Empty license file]\nValidity:    Until Mon Oct 21 17:05:47 2019<\/code><\/pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">the information you have to enter is (we suppose that your orderId is\u00a01571669835 and that your email is me@ntopuser.com)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"832\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_form.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-44058\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_form.png 832w, https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_form-300x139.png 300w, https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_form-768x355.png 768w, https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_form-500x231.png 500w, https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_form-100x46.png 100w, https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_form-480x222.png 480w, https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_form-600x278.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 832px) 100vw, 832px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The generated license will be<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"619\" height=\"368\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_output.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-44059\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_output.png 619w, https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_output-300x178.png 300w, https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_output-500x297.png 500w, https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_output-100x59.png 100w, https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_output-480x285.png 480w, https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/shop_license_generator_output-600x357.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 619px) 100vw, 619px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So you have to execute<\/p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>echo \"Fc8AF....lNQ==\" > \/etc\/ntopng.license<\/code><\/pre>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">on your (offline) system.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"template":"","faq_groups":[763],"class_list":["post-44057","faq","type-faq","status-publish","hentry","faq-group-products-and-licenses"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>How can I generate a license for my (offline) system? - ntop<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/faq\/how-can-i-generate-a-license-for-my-offline-system\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How can I generate a license for my (offline) system? - ntop\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Generating licenses for ntop products requires you to connect to the licensing URL you received during product purchase. You can do this from the system for which you are generating the license, or for another system that has no Internet access at all. All you need to do is to connect to the system that [&hellip;]\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/www.ntop.org\/faq\/how-